## Built like a post

A project page has the same tools as a writing post: a table of contents beside the text, a wide layout and a focus mode, and the same blocks, such as callouts, code, images, columns and footnotes.{% footnoteRef id="shared" /%}

{% footnote id="shared" %}
Projects and posts share one set of components, so anything that works in one works in the other.
{% /footnote %}

{% callout type="good-to-know" title="One editor" %}
Both are written in the same Keystatic editor, with the same components to insert.
{% /callout %}

## Setup

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev
```
